# Dawnhand Dissident: "{T}, Blight 2: Exile target card from a graveyard" and "During your turn, you may cast creature spells
# from among cards you own exiled with this creature by removing three counters from among creatures you control in addition
# to paying their other costs." Bot2's Lightning Bolt puts Bot1's Llanowar Elves into Bot1's graveyard. On turn three Bot1
# casts a Sylvan Caryatid (0/3) and blights 2 onto it (CR 701.68a) to exile the Elves with the Dissident (CR 607.2a). The Elves
# are then cast from exile for {G} and three counters removed (CR 118.8, 601.2f): the Caryatid's two -1/-1 counters and the
# Walking Ballista's one +1/+1 counter, counters of two kinds from two creatures (CR 118.3). The Caryatid is a 0/3 again; the
# Ballista, a 0/0 with no counter, dies (CR 704.5f). The Dissident's {T} leaves it tapped.

